      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Color Guessing Game</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #0f172a;\n      --card-bg: #1e293b;\n      --text-main: #f8fafc;\n      --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n      --accent-primary: #38bdf8;\n      --accent-focus: #fbbf24;\n      --danger-color: #ef4444;\n      --success-color: #22c55e;\n      --border-color: #334155;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 1.25rem;\n    }\n\n    .game-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 480px;\n      background-color: var(--card-bg);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 2rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.625rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .subtitle {\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .scoreboard {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-around;\n      background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);\n      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .score-item {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 0.25rem;\n    }\n\n    .score-label {\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .score-value {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--accent-primary);\n    }\n\n    .target-container {\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n      padding: 1rem;\n      background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      border: 1px dashed var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .target-label {\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n    }\n\n    .rgb-display {\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n      font-size: 1.35rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      user-select: all;\n    }\n\n    .swatches-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 1rem;\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .swatch-btn {\n      position: relative;\n      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n      border: 3px solid #475569;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      outline: none;\n      background: none;\n      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;\n      image-rendering: pixelated;\n    }\n\n    .swatch-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {\n      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.03);\n      border-color: var(--accent-primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    .swatch-btn:active:not(:disabled) {\n      transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);\n    }\n\n    .swatch-btn:focus-visible {\n      border-color: var(--accent-focus);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    .swatch-btn:disabled {\n      cursor: default;\n      opacity: 0.85;\n    }\n\n    .swatch-btn.correct-highlight {\n      border-color: var(--success-color);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5);\n    }\n\n    .status-area {\n      min-height: 2.25rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .status-area.success {\n      color: var(--success-color);\n    }\n\n    .status-area.error {\n      color: var(--danger-color);\n    }\n\n    .action-container {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .action-btn {\n      background-color: var(--accent-primary);\n      color: #0f172a;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;\n    }\n\n    .action-btn:hover {\n      background-color: #7dd3fc;\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .action-btn:active {\n      transform: translateY(1px);\n    }\n\n    .action-btn:focus-visible {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.6);\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 420px) {\n      .game-card {\n        padding: 1.25rem;\n      }\n      .swatches-grid {\n        gap: 0.625rem;\n      }\n      .rgb-display {\n        font-size: 1.15rem;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"game-card\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Pixel Color Guesser</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Match the RGB value to the right pixel swatch</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"scoreboard\" aria-label=\"Game Scores\">\n      <div class=\"score-item\">\n        <span class=\"score-label\">Current Score</span>\n        <span id=\"currentScore\" class=\"score-value\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"score-item\">\n        <span class=\"score-label\">Best Streak</span>\n        <span id=\"bestStreak\" class=\"score-value\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"target-container\" aria-label=\"Target Color\">\n      <div class=\"target-label\">Target Color</div>\n      <div id=\"rgbValueDisplay\" class=\"rgb-display\" aria-live=\"polite\">rgb(0, 0, 0)</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"swatches-grid\" aria-label=\"Color Swatches\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"swatch0\" class=\"swatch-btn\" aria-label=\"Color Swatch 1\"></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"swatch1\" class=\"swatch-btn\" aria-label=\"Color Swatch 2\"></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"swatch2\" class=\"swatch-btn\" aria-label=\"Color Swatch 3\"></button>\n    </section>\n\n    <div id=\"messageDisplay\" class=\"status-area\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"action-container\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"actionBtn\" class=\"action-btn\" hidden>Play Again</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      const STORAGE_KEY = \"pixel_color_guesser_best_streak\";\n      let currentScore = 0;\n      let bestStreak = 0;\n      let targetColor = \"\";\n      let isRoundActive = true;\n\n      const rgbValueDisplay = document.getElementById(\"rgbValueDisplay\");\n      const currentScoreEl = document.getElementById(\"currentScore\");\n      const bestStreakEl = document.getElementById(\"bestStreak\");\n      const messageDisplay = document.getElementById(\"messageDisplay\");\n      const actionBtn = document.getElementById(\"actionBtn\");\n      const swatchButtons = [\n        document.getElementById(\"swatch0\"),\n        document.getElementById(\"swatch1\"),\n        document.getElementById(\"swatch2\")\n      ];\n\n      function loadBestStreak() {\n        try {\n          const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n          if (saved !== null) {\n            const parsed = parseInt(saved, 10);\n            if (!isNaN(parsed) && parsed >= 0) {\n              bestStreak = parsed;\n            }\n          }\n        } catch (e) {\n          // In restricted contexts, localStorage may throw\n          bestStreak = 0;\n        }\n        bestStreakEl.textContent = bestStreak.toString();\n      }\n\n      function saveBestStreak() {\n        try {\n          localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, bestStreak.toString());\n        } catch (e) {\n          // Ignore storage write exceptions\n        }\n      }\n\n      function getRandomInt(min, max) {\n        return Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min;\n      }\n\n      function generateRandomRgb() {\n        const r = getRandomInt(0, 255);\n        const g = getRandomInt(0, 255);\n        const b = getRandomInt(0, 255);\n        return `rgb(${r}, ${g}, ${b})`;\n      }\n\n      function generateDistinctColors(count) {\n        const colors = new Set();\n        while (colors.size < count) {\n          colors.add(generateRandomRgb());\n        }\n        return Array.from(colors);\n      }\n\n      function startNewRound() {\n        isRoundActive = true;\n        actionBtn.hidden = true;\n        messageDisplay.textContent = \"\";\n        messageDisplay.className = \"status-area\";\n\n        const colors = generateDistinctColors(swatchButtons.length);\n        const targetIndex = getRandomInt(0, swatchButtons.length - 1);\n        targetColor = colors[targetIndex];\n\n        rgbValueDisplay.textContent = targetColor;\n\n        swatchButtons.forEach((btn, idx) => {\n          btn.disabled = false;\n          btn.classList.remove(\"correct-highlight\");\n          btn.style.backgroundColor = colors[idx];\n          btn.dataset.color = colors[idx];\n          btn.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", `Color Swatch ${idx + 1}`);\n        });\n      }\n\n      function handleSwatchClick(btn) {\n        if (!isRoundActive) return;\n\n        const selectedColor = btn.dataset.color;\n\n        if (selectedColor === targetColor) {\n          currentScore++;\n          currentScoreEl.textContent = currentScore.toString();\n\n          if (currentScore > bestStreak) {\n            bestStreak = currentScore;\n            bestStreakEl.textContent = bestStreak.toString();\n            saveBestStreak();\n          }\n\n          messageDisplay.textContent = \"Correct! Keep going!\";\n          messageDisplay.className = \"status-area success\";\n\n          // Brief transition before loading next swatches\n          isRoundActive = false;\n          setTimeout(() => {\n            startNewRound();\n          }, 350);\n        } else {\n          isRoundActive = false;\n          messageDisplay.textContent = \"Game Over! Wrong swatch.\";\n          messageDisplay.className = \"status-area error\";\n\n          swatchButtons.forEach(b => {\n            b.disabled = true;\n            if (b.dataset.color === targetColor) {\n              b.classList.add(\"correct-highlight\");\n            }\n          });\n\n          currentScore = 0;\n          currentScoreEl.textContent = currentScore.toString();\n          actionBtn.hidden = false;\n          actionBtn.focus();\n        }\n      }\n\n      swatchButtons.forEach(btn => {\n        btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => handleSwatchClick(btn));\n      });\n\n      actionBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        startNewRound();\n      });\n\n      loadBestStreak();\n      startNewRound();\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Main single-page HTML file providing semantic markup, accessible swatch buttons, game controls, score board, and embedded CSS and JavaScript for the pixel color guessing game."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Color Guessing Game\n\nA responsive, accessible, zero-dependency browser game built with vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Players are presented with a target RGB color string and must identify the matching pixel swatch among distractors.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Offline First**: Zero external packages, fonts, CDN assets, or server dependencies.\n- **Keyboard & Screen Reader Accessible**: Semantic controls with accessible names (`aria-label`), visible `:focus-visible` styling, and `[hidden] { display: none !important; }` enforcement.\n- **Score & Streak Tracking**: Persists all-time best streak in `localStorage` with fail-safe fallback for private/sandboxed modes.\n- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-friendly layout designed for viewports from 360px wide upwards.\n- **Instant Feedback**: Visual indication of correct swatches on game over and seamless progression upon correct guesses.\n\n## How to Play\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern web browser.\n2. Read the displayed target RGB value (e.g. `rgb(45, 120, 210)`).\n3. Click or navigate with <kbd>Tab</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd>/<kbd>Space</kbd> to select the swatch you believe matches.\n4. Guessing correctly increments your streak score and presents a new round.\n5. An incorrect guess ends the round, highlights the matching swatch, and lets you restart via **Play Again**.\n",
      "description": "Project overview, gameplay instructions, accessibility details, and technical considerations."
    }
  ]
}